<title>INDIA: India's RBI maintains repo cut-off at 3.60 pct.</title>
<headline>India's RBI maintains repo cut-off at 3.60 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of India (RBI) said on Thursday it maintained the cut-off at 3.60 percent at its three-day repo auction of government securities.</p>
<p>The RBI said it received 20 bids for 65.75 billion rupees of which it accepted 18 for 63.65 billion.</p>
<p>The weighted average cut-off was 3.5620 percent, it said.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom 91222659000</p>
</text>
